---
/**
 * MediaCard — card with image placeholder, title, description, CTA button.
 *
 * Token consumption:
 *   astro-card           → surface panel (bg-surface, padding, border, radius)
 *   astro-section-title  → card title
 *   astro-body           → description text
 *   astro-button         → CTA button (accent fill)
 */
---

<div class="astro-card" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:var(--astro-vsp-sm);max-width:24rem">
  {/* reason: card max-width is page-local; no structural token covers card widths */}
  <div style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:16/9;border-radius:var(--astro-radius);overflow:hidden">
    {/* reason: image aspect is a media constant, not a token — CSS gradient placeholder; no network fetch */}
    <div
      style="width:100%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--astro-color-surface) 0%, var(--astro-color-muted) 100%)"
      aria-hidden="true"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="astro-section-title">Intro to Design Tokens</div>
  <div class="astro-body">
    Design tokens are the smallest atomic values in a design system — spacing,
    colour, typography — stored as CSS custom properties and shared across every
    component.
  </div>
  <div>
    <div role="button" tabindex="0" class="astro-button">Learn more</div>
  </div>
</div>
